sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Emitter
  participant Driver
  participant Dispatcher
  participant Handler
  App->>Emitter: emit message, priority
  Emitter->>Driver: send
  Emitter-->>App: return
  Dispatcher->>Driver: wait
  Driver-->>Dispatcher: callback message, priority
  Dispatcher->>Handler: handle
  alt returns
    Handler-->>Dispatcher: true or false
  else throws
    Handler-->>Dispatcher: exception
    Dispatcher->>Driver: maybe send a retry copy
  end
